
Usage: /SUBMIT <username> <message>
  When  the  channe  is  moderated, only operators can say things.  In
  this  case  normal  users  will  have  to  submit  messages  to  the
  operators.   The  operators  can then post these messages at will or
  cancel  them  altogether.  <message> specifies the message you would
  normally type in a non-moderated channel.

  Example:
     /SUBMIT bigcheese It is now my turn to speak...

  See Also:
     /QUEUE

